      "content": "thanks that's a good start. my prof is super tough on \"meritocracy\" arguments though. like, if i bring up the idea that people should just work harder to get ahead, it feels like it just ignores everything we talked about in the first part of the outline. how can i write this so it makes the meritocracy argument look basically invalid or even harmful to the goal of racial equity?",
